description:
Competenze STEM è l'app dei dipendenti di STEM S.r.l. per seguire le proprie competenze e fare la valutazione trimestrale fra colleghi.

Con l'app puoi:
• votare i colleghi da 1 a 10 quando si apre il giro del trimestre;
• vedere il tuo punteggio, aspetto per aspetto, e la classifica;
• guardare le tue competenze: la ragnatela, i moduli, quello che hai imparato;
• controllare i tuoi corsi di sicurezza e le scadenze.

I colleghi non sanno mai che voto hai dato.

L'accesso è riservato ai dipendenti di STEM: si entra con la propria email e un codice che arriva per email, senza password.

Informativa sul trattamento dei dati: https://competenze.stemhtservice.com/t/informativa

FanProof helps fans prepare for games, concerts, and live events with practical, source-backed venue guidance.

Search for a covered venue, review the details that matter before arrival, and save a compact plan for event day. Saved plans stay available on your device when cellular service is slow or unavailable.

Use FanProof to:

- review arrival, transit, parking, bag, entry, and accessibility guidance when a reviewed official source is available;
- see when each source was reviewed;
- save a venue plan and optional event date locally on your device;
- refresh a saved plan without losing the last valid offline copy; and
- open official venue resources, directions, parking, and eligible ticket links.

Venue policies and event operations can change. FanProof shows source-review dates and links to official resources so you can confirm time-sensitive details before relying on them.

FanProof is independent and is not affiliated with any venue, team, league, ticketing platform, or event promoter.
